Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:43.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,1944年 一个超自然事物研究小组{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1944 a team of paranormal researchers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在苏格兰海岸执行秘密任务时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together with the US Army, rescued a strange creature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.11,0:00:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,与美军一起解救了一只奇异生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}During a classified mission off the coast of Scotland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.99,0:00:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只生物被秘密收养{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sectetly adopted, this creature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:00:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,与我们生活在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now lives among us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.70,0:01:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爱吃糖果 爱看电视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It loves candy and TV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.44,0:01:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的代号：地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code Name: Hellboy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新墨西哥州 道格拉斯美军基地）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.56,0:01:15.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（1955年 圣诞夜）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 把那糟糕的木偶戏关掉吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son, will you turn off that wretched puppet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去刷牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brush your teeth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.42,0:01:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫他木偶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call him a puppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I beg your pardon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.69,0:01:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍迪·多蒂不是木偶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, he's not a puppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.39,0:01:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是真人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy doody's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.69,0:01:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是真人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… he's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.93,0:01:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,得跟滴滴嘟嘟先生说再见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. deedee doodoo will have to say good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.53,0:01:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.37,0:01:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 当圣诞老人从烟囱下来时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, you have to be asleep{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.97,0:01:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得睡着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he comes down the chimney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,连个烟囱都没有 爷爷 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not even a chimney, pop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.41,0:01:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自有办法的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has his ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:01:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我想醒着看他怎么下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I want to wait up. watch him do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,胡闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nonsense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我想听故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I want a story then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 今晚可没故事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. no stories tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.58,0:02:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个嘛 然后我就去睡觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just one. and then I'll go to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,听完马上就睡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还会去刷牙 我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'll brush my teeth, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 在开天辟地之时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is said that at the dawn of time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类 野兽和所有魔族生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, beast and all magical beings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.06,0:02:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,共同生活在树神艾格林之下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lived together under Aiglin the father tree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.28,0:02:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但人类的心脏天生有一个洞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But man had been created with a hole in his heart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.28,0:02:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,财富 权利或知识都无法填充它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hole that no possession, power or knowledge could fill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.85,0:02:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为人类永无止境的欲望{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in his infinite greed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.16,0:02:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们企图占领整个地球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man dreamt of expanding his dominion over the entire earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多精灵 魔鬼和妖精{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood of many an elf, ogre and goblin{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都惨死在人类的屠刀下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was spilled in their war with man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,独臂精灵王巴罗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And king balor, the one-armed king of elfland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.12,0:03:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,目睹了这场屠杀 他绝望而且恐惧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watched the slaughter in dread and despair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到有一天 妖精中的铸造大师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But one day, the master of the goblin blacksmiths{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.89,0:03:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,提出要为精灵王打造一支黄金军团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offered to build the king a golden mechanical army, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.07,0:03:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,由4900名士兵组成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Seventy times 70 soldiers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们永不知疲倦 没人可以阻挡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would never know hunger and could not be stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,努阿达王子恳求精灵王批准这个建议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince nuada begged his father to agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.61,0:03:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,精灵王最终说 为我建造这支军团吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Build me this army, " the king said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.46,0:03:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 他造出了一顶魔法王冠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So a magical crown was forged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将让具有皇族血统的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would allow those of royal blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.83,0:03:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,领导这支黄金军团 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To command the golden army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前提是他的皇威不能被挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If unchallenged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.73,0:04:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是精灵王巴罗 黄金军团的领导者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am king balor, leader of the golden army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人胆敢挑战我的皇威吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Is there anyone who disputes my right?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.57,0:04:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人回应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in his throne room no one challenged his word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.31,0:04:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 等等 如果有人挑战呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, wait, what if someone could challenge him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会决斗吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would they have a fight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, most likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.01,0:04:17.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战是必须回应的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A challenge must be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.28,0:04:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想知道故事的结果吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But do you want to hear the end of this story or not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,想听 想听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.62,0:04:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.75,0:04:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 世界的局势改变了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the world was changed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当人类再次进军的时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the next time the humans marched, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.96,0:04:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们感到大地在脚下振颤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They felt the earth tremble beneath their feet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.66,0:04:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,天空被魔影笼罩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And saw the sky darken with monstrous shapes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.34,0:04:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金军团没有怜悯 忠诚或者痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden army had no remorse, felt no loyalty or pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.82,0:04:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但精灵王万分悔恨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And king balor's heart grew heavy with regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 他宣布停战 并把王冠分成三部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he called a truce and divided the crown in three pieces, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个给人类保管 剩下的留给自己{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One for the humans, and two for himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.36,0:05:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为交换 人类获得了城市 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange, man would keep to the cities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而魔族生物则拥有森林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the magical beings would own the forests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这停战协定将会被{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This truce would be honored{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.03,0:05:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,世世代代尊奉下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by their sons and the sons of their sons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.11,0:05:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到世界消亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until the end of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.14,0:05:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但努阿达王子并不信任人类的承诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But prince nuada did not believe in the promises of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.11,0:05:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说他离开家乡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it is said that he went into exile, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.18,0:05:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,并发誓会在他的人民最需要他的时候回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vowing to return the day his people needed him most.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.95,0:05:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是 黄金军团无人支配{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the golden army lay dormant, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.62,0:05:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,并被囚于大地之中 等待着召唤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locked inside the earth, waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到今天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there it is to this day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍在等待王冠重新合而为一的时刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awaiting the day the crown is made whole again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.84,0:05:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们安静地等待着 永不消亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Silent, still and indestructible."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.51,0:05:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不消亡是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. what does it mean "industrable"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不消亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indestructible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不消…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indestruct…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说没人可以消灭它们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means no one can destroy them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.18,0:06:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡了 孩子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to sleep, my son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.39,0:06:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是个故事 对吧 爷爷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's just a story, right, pops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逗了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.92,0:06:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人不可能是真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys, they can't be real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 总有一天你会明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my son, I'm sure you'll find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.45,0:06:58.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,《地狱男爵2：黄金军团》
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这呆多久了 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long have you been there, my friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.90,0:07:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天买来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bought them today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没喂呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't fed them at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先上去 你跟着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go up first. you will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 文克先生 别害羞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remember, mr. wink, don't be shy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:35.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（曼哈顿 9月26日 20点）
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.04,0:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一件拍品 776号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next lot. number 776.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一尊地位很高的雕像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an important votive figure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.28,0:08:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,丰饶女神 时代大约在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fertility goddess dating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.88,0:08:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,西元前10000到15000年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Approximately 15, 000 to 10, 000 b.c{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.19,0:08:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件拍卖品是在{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was found in a loess deposit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:54.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,离夏侬30米的黄土坑里发现的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a terrace about 30 meters from the shannon river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.63,0:08:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,底价为30万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll open the bidding at $300, 000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.70,0:08:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,30万美元{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred thousand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.96,0:09:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,32万5千 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred and twenty-five, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.57,0:09:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,35万 谢谢你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred and fifty, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,37万5千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three seventy-five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,37万5千{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred and seventy-five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,37万5千一次 两次 成交{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going once. going twice. sold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.75,0:09:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,下件拍品 777号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we move on to our next item, lot 777, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片来自贝茨莫拉圣冠的碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A piece of the royal crown of bethmoora.{\r}
