Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 曼宁 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Manning. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.45,0:16:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得去曼哈顿的闹市区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to downtown manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:32.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 肯定很好玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it'll be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,闹市区 很危险的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Downtown. very dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然对我也很危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.16,0:16:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你想去外面世界{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know you dream of the outside world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.42,0:16:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是相信我 外面世界不好玩的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, trust me, it's not that great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里很野蛮 很糟糕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's savage, as a matter of fact. bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧伙计们 咱们出去吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, fellas, let's get this out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个很不错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These, on the other hand, are good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.60,0:16:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,古巴雪茄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuban.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.24,0:16:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.81,0:16:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人看到的话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Being seen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.01,0:16:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,很糟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,正确 我买了好几箱 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. I confiscated a box of these, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.98,0:17:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再给你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'll get you some more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.04,0:17:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但今晚在外面的时候你得帮我个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you've gotta do me a little favor tonight, out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须非常非常…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to be… you have to be very, very…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.22,0:17:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨慎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.29,0:17:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 谢谢 对 - 不客气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? thank you. yes. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨慎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Discreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.19,0:17:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,当个隐形人 进去 出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Invisible. in and out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.49,0:17:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能吗 {\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.53,0:17:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我愿意 我也可以谨慎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I can be discreet if I wanna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.27,0:17:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟踪过你和迈尔斯 记得吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I followed you and myers, didn't i?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.83,0:17:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 接着你就被送到了南极洲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you had him transferred to antarctica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真谨慎啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very discreet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.77,0:17:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他喜欢寒冷嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he liked the cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会像影子一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.71,0:17:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,像夜晚的影子一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a shadow in the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:50.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（曼哈顿 23点37分）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.03,0:17:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国海关发现非法进口物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us customs discovered a few illegally imported items.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一些气囊 属于轻微违法物品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a minor infraction. and a gas pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.17,0:18:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那里发现些气囊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They detected a gas pocket up there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.17,0:18:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在联邦调查局 在我的指挥下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now fbi agents, under my command, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,正戴着防护装备上楼去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are going up there right now with special gas equipment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 这里真臭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeez, it stinks in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.09,0:18:17.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里比我的房间还乱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is worse than my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.69,0:18:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在等这东西的报告{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for a report on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.59,0:18:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,说「茄子」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "cheese."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.86,0:18:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他们叫我们来干什么 看来没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever they called us for is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:18:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告说这里有70多位宾客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had over 70 guests reported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.63,0:19:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有生还者 也没有尸体{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no survivors, no bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:03.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里也是 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same story here, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别叫我「宝贝」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me "babe."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的是「亚伯」 频道错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Abe, " I said."abe." wrong channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.04,0:19:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯 我想丽兹还在生我的气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe, I think liz is still mad at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是一样的频道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still the same channel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.63,0:19:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,能问你个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I ask you a question?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.33,0:19:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一会儿回到家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen. When we get home later, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.24,0:19:40.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会收拾我的烂摊子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna clean up my whole mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.47,0:19:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.95,0:19:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯 你有什么发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe, what have you got?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.32,0:19:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, this is interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.55,0:19:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个盒子都有皇家印章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both boxes have the royal seal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们只在战时才生产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only delivered at a time of war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.30,0:20:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 我们有伴了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red? We have company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 布鲁 给我点活干{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, blue, give me something to work with here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.70,0:20:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞穴生物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Burrowing creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有多少 - 很多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many of them? - Many.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.74,0:20:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有尸体是因为这里没有什么遗留物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no corpses because there are no leftovers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.81,0:20:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意过地板吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you noticed the floor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的（还有粪便之意）{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.88,0:20:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Precisely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.95,0:20:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们要做的就是不停地吃啊吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these things do is eat and eat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.02,0:21:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后排便 然后再吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then poop, and then eat again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你想起谁了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind you of anyone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.59,0:21:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的 亚伯 这些是什么东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, abe. What are these things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.13,0:21:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说英语 说英语{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}English, english.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是牙齿仙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're tooth fairies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.00,0:21:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 它们生活在三世纪的德国山林区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Third century, black forest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.13,0:21:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,主要以钙 骨头 皮肤和器官为食{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feed mostly on calcium, bones, skin, organs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它们会先吃牙齿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they do go for the teeth first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以唤作嗜齿仙子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence the name tooth fairies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.91,0:21:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说它们也吃钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you they don't leave money, either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.39,0:21:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 你有身孕了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz, you're pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.83,0:21:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有 你是有了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.14,0:22:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那有什么发现 马博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got, marble?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.98,0:22:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我找到了一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I may have found one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过它看起来还算可爱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's kind of cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.82,0:22:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别靠近它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go near it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在咬我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's biting me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.90,0:22:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,马博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.30,0:22:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痛 好痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hurts! It hurts!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.09,0:22:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 我们这需要你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, we need you here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,马博{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.23,0:22:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些肮脏的小…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着开枪 亚伯 接着开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep firing, abe. Keep firing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.32,0:23:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.79,0:23:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.89,0:23:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上有保险室{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a safe upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.93,0:24:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们怎么上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.40,0:24:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我们开路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a clearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.93,0:24:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.84,0:24:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,到保险室去 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up to the safe, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.78,0:24:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯 上楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe. Up the stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.72,0:24:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 丽兹 烧死它们 快走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, liz, burn them all. Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.82,0:24:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we're going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到保险室去 亚伯 到保险室去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the safe, abe. Get in the safe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.87,0:24:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.11,0:24:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.71,0:24:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,史帝尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.69,0:25:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些该死的小畜生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damned beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.13,0:25:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,火由我生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.53,0:25:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我身孕火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is in me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.80,0:25:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 离窗户远点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, stay away from the window!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.67,0:25:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,火即是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别咬了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop biting me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.41,0:25:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,火即是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire is me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.15,0:25:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,俗世 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}World, here I come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.03,0:26:20.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都干了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.74,0:26:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们暴露了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess we're out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.97,0:26:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,地狱男爵 这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hellboy, over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:41.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（铁路院子东边 午夜）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.17,0:27:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的殿下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your royal highness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.90,0:27:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,努阿达王子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.64,0:27:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎您归来{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.09,0:27:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入会议厅前{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before entering the council chamber, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.23,0:27:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,您必须交出武器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must surrender your weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.80,0:27:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会交的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.37,0:27:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下 无论贫富贵贱 我们一视同仁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is protocol, sire, for peasant and prince alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.53,0:27:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,议会长 我很荣幸可以亲手了结你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.54,0:27:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样 哥哥{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.95,0:27:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出武器吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.66,0:27:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,妹妹 为了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you, sister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.36,0:27:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样都可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.06,0:27:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,据消息灵通人士透露{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to multiple eye witnesses, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.06,0:27:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们正出于危险之中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lives were, in fact, endangered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.14,0:28:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you have it, hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.74,0:28:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是我们这边的吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is he really on our side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.54,0:28:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有超能力吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have superpowers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.91,0:28:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.21,0:28:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的只想做个普通人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, really, all I wanna be is just an ordinary person, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你和其他人一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you and you and everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.25,0:28:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 你们快错过新闻了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. You're missing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.38,0:28:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上电视了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on tv.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.25,0:28:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽兹 丽兹 你还好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liz. Liz, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.92,0:28:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好 我一会出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, i'll be out in a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用这么做 相信我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do that. You can trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我算的很准的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My readings are quite accurate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.86,0:28:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.10,0:28:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手拿开那扇门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your damn hand away from the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.60,0:28:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不用担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.87,0:28:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管相貌并不出众{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In spite of appearances, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.24,0:28:37.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信红大个会是个出色的父亲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe red would be an excellent father figure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.11,0:28:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这家伙呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.74,0:28:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴着个马桶座圈走来走去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walking around with a toilet seat on his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.51,0:28:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马桶座圈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toilet seat!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.81,0:28:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 这是呼吸器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quite obvious it's a breathing apparatus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.25,0:28:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们得丢了那辆垃圾车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I think we gotta lose the garbage truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.55,0:28:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会发出错误的信号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sends out the wrong signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.79,0:28:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这是我们的问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's our problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.09,0:28:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,运输吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transportation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.40,0:29:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这个女孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this girl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一定得找出她得了什么病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We definitely have to find out what's wrong with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.23,0:29:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过她很可爱 我们应该让她上节目{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's cute, though. We should get her on the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.37,0:29:07.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌人们盯着我看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate it when people stare at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.27,0:29:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我感觉自己跟怪胎似的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes me feel like a freak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.01,0:29:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有权利 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had no right, red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是曼宁 你能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's manning. Could you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.41,0:29:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我告诉你多少次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times do I have to tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.51,0:29:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是气孔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gas pocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.35,0:29:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种现象发生在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a gaseous phenomenon that occurred…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.35,0:29:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,气孔 真是个笨蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gas pocket. What an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.39,0:29:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被你害惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've murdered me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被你害惨了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have murdered me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.27,0:29:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还嘲弄我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have ridiculed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.64,0:29:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你自找的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have brought this unto yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.81,0:29:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.14,0:29:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿那边派下来一名新的BPRD干员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington is sending down a new bprd agent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.14,0:29:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,来新人了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.55,0:29:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.95,0:29:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是来关照你的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To look after you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.92,0:30:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,殿下 请{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.42,0:30:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.98,0:30:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.73,0:30:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么要这么做？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.39,0:30:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.85,0:30:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了重获自由 所有人的自由 父王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To set us free. All of us, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.81,0:30:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经破坏了古时我们同人类…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.52,0:30:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,制定的的休战协定{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.32,0:30:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是用耻辱换来的休战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A truce based on shame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.63,0:30:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类已经忘了谁是他们的神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans have forgotten the gods, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.43,0:30:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们破坏了地球 为了什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroyed the earth. And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.80,0:30:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,停车场 商业街{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parking lots. Shopping malls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.87,0:30:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的心已被贪婪所吞噬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greed has burned a hole in their heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的欲望永远不能满足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will never be filled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.27,0:30:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,永不知足{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will never have enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.50,0:30:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类这么做是出于天性{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.17,0:30:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守协定是我们值得荣耀的天性{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.95,0:30:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,荣耀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.05,0:31:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这地方 荣耀何在？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this place. Where is the honor in it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.32,0:31:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王 你曾是个受人尊敬的勇士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, you were once a proud warrior.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.76,0:31:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么时候变成了他们的玩物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you become their pet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:15.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我结束流放 回来挑起战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have returned from exile to wage war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.06,0:31:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,来收回我们的土地 我们天赐的权利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And reclaim our land, our birthright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.94,0:31:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为此 我会发动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that, I will call upon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.40,0:31:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的子民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The help of all of my people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.94,0:31:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论他们善恶与否{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they will answer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.14,0:31:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是最邪恶的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good, the bad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.41,0:31:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会应声而起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the worst.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金军团{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.38,0:31:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是疯了吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.58,0:31:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我是疯了 也许是它们让我这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps I am. Perhaps they made me so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.35,0:31:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,唤醒军团…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.89,0:31:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的绿地也不会在鲜血中生长{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.54,0:31:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,让军团就这么睡去吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.98,0:31:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们的时代结束了…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就应该隐退{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.17,0:31:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会隐退的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not fade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.79,0:31:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后一次问你 儿子{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.65,0:31:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真要这么做吗？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.61,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.44,0:32:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 父王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry, father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.67,0:32:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我别无选择{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.48,0:32:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须死{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.19,0:32:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, sister, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.74,0:32:20.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赞同父王的决定吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you at peace with your king's verdict?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.36,0:32:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 哥哥 我赞同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am, my brother. I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.17,0:32:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 死就死吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then very well. Death it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.90,0:34:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是爱你的 父亲{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.02,0:34:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有最后一块 妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, for the final piece, my sister.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.89,0:34:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪 文克 她在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she, wink? Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.30,0:34:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找到她 快去 找到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go find her. Now! Find her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.01,0:34:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯已到42层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator arriving now to section 42.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.61,0:34:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯已到42层{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevator arriving now to section 42.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.85,0:34:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 大伙 借过 借过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pardon me, boys. Excuse me. Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他来了吗 - 还没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he here? - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.46,0:35:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说 我们不需要这家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, we don't need this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.69,0:35:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们需要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.86,0:35:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,看得出 他可是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidently, this guy's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.17,0:35:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,华盛顿那边的大人物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the big shot in washington.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.56,0:35:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.73,0:35:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫乔汉·克拉斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is johann krauss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.83,0:35:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉·克拉斯吗 听起来像德国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann krauss? Sounds german.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.50,0:35:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在外质学方面 他可是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the top man in…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.14,0:35:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨擘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ectoplasmic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.24,0:35:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 谢谢 外质学研究专家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you. Ectoplasmic research.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:20.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,由我们的欧洲联络会强力推荐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comes highly recommended by our european liaison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.14,0:35:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乔汉·克拉斯 - 联络{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Johann krauss. - "Liaison."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.58,0:35:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱这个词 你不爱吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love that word, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.25,0:35:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是带劲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's so hoity toity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.85,0:35:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不喜欢德国人 - 没有指纹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't like germans. - No fingerprints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.38,0:35:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他来了 - 德国人让我紧张{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here he comes. - Germans make me nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.15,0:35:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有图片 档案上有的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No photo. Dossier says, {\r}
