Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.59,1:08:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许上面有浮水印{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps there's a watermark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.83,1:08:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常勇敢 为我担保{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were very brave vouching for me.{\r}
