Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.91,1:09:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,平常我可以很快地读出这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally I'm able to read others quite quickly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.02,1:09:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我从没遇到像你一样的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I've never met anyone like you.{\r}
