Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.94,1:10:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我可以拿走你佩的徽章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I could take away your badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.74,1:10:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没那玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never had one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.71,1:10:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续问{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kept asking, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.95,1:10:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要学会服从我 遵守规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will learn to obey me, follow protocol{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.22,1:10:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且随时保持春醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And stay fockused at all times.{\r}
