Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.02,1:10:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是你的口音 我才不会那么说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, with your accent, I wouldn't use it that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.19,1:10:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识 布鲁姆教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew professor Broom, young man.{\r}
