Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.56,1:10:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.80,1:10:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我出事后 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After my accident… - Shut up. shut up.{\r}
