Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.93,1:10:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一位极好的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wonderful man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.60,1:10:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使如此他还是对你的未来非常担心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And even then he was worried about your future. he…{\r}
