Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.77,1:10:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.87,1:10:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然怎样 你在威胁我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what? are you threatening me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.34,1:10:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为我可以打败你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think I can take you.{\r}
