Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.45,1:10:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.32,1:11:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不清 从那么远的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't hear you from all the way over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.49,1:11:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能打败你 因为你有一个致命的缺点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take you because you have one fatal flaw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.29,1:11:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒想听听看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wanna hear it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.46,1:11:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你根本听不进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't. you can't take criticism.{\r}
