Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听不进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.87,1:11:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的缺点是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's my flaw?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.80,1:11:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脾气 它掩盖你的优点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your temper. it gets the best of you.{\r}
