Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.68,1:11:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.86,1:11:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉 乔汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann? johann?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.93,1:11:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, johann?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.07,1:11:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,别扯了 老兄 坚持住 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pal. hang in there, will you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.57,1:11:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉 乔汉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann? johann?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.11,1:11:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.{\r}
