Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.89,1:12:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脾气 让你变得脆弱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your temper, it makes you sloppy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.52,1:12:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,努力控制它吧 地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to control it, agent hellboy.{\r}
