Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.77,1:13:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.84,1:13:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来晚了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're up late.{\r}
