Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.67,1:15:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像一首歌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like a song{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.97,1:15:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我光亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And brightened my day{\r}
