Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.05,1:16:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你无法微笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you know I can't sile without you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.42,1:16:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你无法微笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't smile without you{\r}
