Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.02,1:17:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可以问 她们会因你不知道而生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't ask because then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.86,1:17:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们会因你后知后觉而生气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get angry because you had to ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.93,1:17:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.43,1:17:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 别回答了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind, don't answer that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.86,1:17:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.43,1:17:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.54,1:17:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己找出答案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.74,1:18:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动作真快 羊皮纸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very quick of you. the parchment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.61,1:18:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was of no importance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.95,1:18:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆筒却很有趣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cylinder is very interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.22,1:18:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在这里找到黄金军团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will find the golden army here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.56,1:18:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于皇冠的碎片 我知道它就在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for the crown piece, I know it's here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.07,1:18:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以通过你感觉到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel that much from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.07,1:18:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王总是费尽心机把你我的心分隔开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father always tried so hard to shield your heart from mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.24,1:18:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,碎片就在某本书里 我会找出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's in one of the books, and I will find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.85,1:18:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.48,1:18:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿蓝色总是特别漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always look so beautiful in blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.55,1:18:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓝色{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.72,1:18:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,诗歌 爱情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poetry. love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.99,1:18:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,得而复失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Found then lost."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.26,1:19:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 我会找出来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only words. I will find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.67,1:19:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, listen, Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.30,1:19:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道丽兹怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's going on with Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.77,1:19:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.27,1:19:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.24,1:19:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 他必须知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. he has to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.48,1:19:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.65,1:19:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.39,1:19:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.75,1:19:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 我先进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back. I'll go first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.66,1:19:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕 别过来 他会杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham. no, don't… he'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.26,1:19:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,公主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.70,1:19:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.01,1:19:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那样叫他？{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.07,1:19:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.60,1:19:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会杀了你 亚伯拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will kill you, Abraham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.77,1:19:39.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者其他任何人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyone else if that is necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.41,1:19:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.91,1:19:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你不从我开始 混蛋殿下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then why don't you just start with me, your royal assness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.55,1:19:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是谁放的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put those there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.02,1:19:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你空着手就想跟我打{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your weapon of choice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.69,1:19:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要收拾你 五根手指还嫌多呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five-fingered mary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.26,1:19:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你动一下我就杀了亚伯拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You move and I'll kill your Abraham first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.74,1:20:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 你绝不能伤了王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, you mustn't harm the prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.37,1:20:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.57,1:20:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤了他 公主也会受伤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hurt him, you hurt the princess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.71,1:20:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.05,1:20:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我皇冠的碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you give me the crown piece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.25,1:20:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.50,1:20:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 碎片 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The piece. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.40,1:21:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.46,1:21:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 红大个 但他们命运相连{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, I'm so sorry, but they're linked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.80,1:21:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.10,1:21:14.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 红大个 - 丽兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Red. - Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.73,1:21:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 小心后面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.64,1:21:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去你可曾想过「我终将面对死亡吗」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may have mused in the past, "am I mortal?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.61,1:21:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就是了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.62,1:21:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕 许多人为了皇冠而死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham, many people have died for this crown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.93,1:21:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也不例外{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.96,1:21:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想救他 并再见到她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to save him and see her again, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.90,1:21:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就找出遗失的皇冠碎片 带来给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will find the missing piece and bring it to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.28,1:22:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 亚伯 快把这该死的东西拔出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Abe, pull the damn thing out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.81,1:22:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.11,1:22:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次我一靠近它 一碰它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I touch it, every time I come close to it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.55,1:22:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就更深地刺向他的心脏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It moves closer to his heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.59,1:22:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无计可施{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what else to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.39,1:22:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非拔掉矛尖 不然伤口无法愈合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wound will not heal until the spear is removed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.03,1:22:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.46,1:22:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们去找王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we go after the prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.73,1:22:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼他把矛尖拿出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we make him take it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.90,1:22:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 丽兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.64,1:22:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那时问我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were asking me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.87,1:23:00.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.07,1:23:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 让我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, let me tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.71,1:23:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道什么对我来说重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.34,1:23:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.48,1:23:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.41,1:23:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以不管全世界 不顾一切{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could turn my back on the world, all of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.79,1:23:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你和我在一起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as you stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.56,1:23:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll stay with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.16,1:23:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我遇过最好的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best man I've ever met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.03,1:23:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「人」吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Man."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.03,1:23:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,努阿拉 「请来我身边 当我年已暮」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuala."Be near and when light is low."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.56,1:23:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,“血气已衰落…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"When the blood creeps…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.07,1:24:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我心感到沉重 当生命的机能已麻木”{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the heart is sick and all the wheels of being slow"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.61,1:24:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆筒上的坐标指向{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cylinder yielded coordinates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.35,1:24:14.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,位于爱尔兰北部安特里姆郡的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To county Antrim, northern ireland.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.91,1:24:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大堤道 就是这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The giant's causeway. right about here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.75,1:24:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 知道他在哪儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. so we know where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.62,1:24:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那还等什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.72,1:24:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,该上路了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should get going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.89,1:24:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼探员 王子要皇冠的碎片{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prince will demand the crown piece, agent sherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.86,1:24:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又如何 我们给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we give it to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.59,1:24:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼宁博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Manning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.06,1:24:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情恐怕没这么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid it's not as simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.40,1:24:34.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on here, what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.73,1:24:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝不能唤醒黄金军团{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden army must not awaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.20,1:24:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.87,1:24:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就眼睁睁看着他死 是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna let him die, is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.31,1:24:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.44,1:24:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们禀告了华盛顿当局 只能听命行事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We called Washington. we have our orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.95,1:24:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也这么想吗 他救过你一命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about you? he saved your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.28,1:24:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.95,1:24:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很难接受 但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this is difficult for you, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.02,1:24:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便你 我不会让他死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I won't let him die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.76,1:24:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢尔曼探员 我要提醒你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent sherman, may I remind you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.56,1:25:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I am the leader of this team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.60,1:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那毋庸置疑 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's no doubt about that, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.40,1:25:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你 克拉斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what you are, Dr. Krauss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.40,1:25:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你曾是人类 那也是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if ever you were human, that time is long gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.77,1:25:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,她吃错了什么药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.81,1:25:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我叫她回来吗 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to call her back, sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.04,1:25:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.48,1:25:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能理解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.88,1:25:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.75,1:25:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到什么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.25,1:25:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 目前还没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.72,1:25:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就继续找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.25,1:25:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 长官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.72,1:25:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部都去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.52,1:25:30.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心长官 碎片在这里 我们会找到的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't worry, sir, we know it's here, and we're gonna find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.49,1:25:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有汤姆·曼宁办不成的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Tom Manning gets on the case, things get done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.66,1:25:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情说成 就得成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get done. they get done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.46,1:25:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说到做到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}100. I guarantee that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.15,1:25:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使没有碎片 也要把他带离这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even without the piece, we have to get him out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.35,1:26:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去安特里姆郡找王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go to Antrim, and we will find the prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.29,1:26:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.56,1:26:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都去找{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask you, everybody, keep looking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.66,1:26:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.26,1:26:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们俩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the two of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.80,1:26:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.27,1:26:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.85,1:26:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就得走 趁他们还没找到楼上前走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to leave now, before they run our clearance upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.39,1:26:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好啊[德语]{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guten abend, eine freunde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.86,1:26:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人批准你们把飞机开走吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have authorization to take that plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.83,1:26:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉 你阻止不了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna stop us, Johann.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.96,1:26:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反 我想过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary, I've been giving it some thought, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.50,1:26:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该有办法救地狱男爵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we should be able to save agent hellboy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.30,1:26:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我不是人类了 但你错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say I'm not human anymore, but you are wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.94,1:26:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常能理解你的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand your pain all too well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.64,1:26:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前 我失去了我挚爱的女人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A long time ago, I lost the woman I loved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.68,1:27:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那也是我变成现在这副悲惨模样的源头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was, in fact, the source of my present misfortune.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.32,1:27:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来我会告诉你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will tell you about it one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.02,1:27:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在 我们较占优势{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, the tactical advantage is ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.02,1:27:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,试想下 王子的皇冠少了一块{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consider this, the prince lacks the crown piece{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.92,1:27:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇冠不全 他的军团就没有威胁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without it, his army poses no threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.59,1:27:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得到批准了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we have clearance, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.09,1:27:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的批准 谢尔曼·丽兹探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Sherman Liz, screw the clearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.40,1:27:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去开飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will take that plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.90,1:27:28.77,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安特里姆郡 北爱尔兰 9点）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.36,1:27:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be here someplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.13,1:27:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口应该就在这儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entrance should be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.23,1:27:52.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.67,1:27:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许地图有错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps there's a mistake on the map.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.54,1:28:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.08,1:28:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你们 陌生人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you welcome, strangers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.74,1:28:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮忙的呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I be of assistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.35,1:28:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找通向贝茨莫拉的安全道路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We seek safe passage to Bethmoora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.08,1:28:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样的人儿为何想去那种地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does a nice little girl like you want in the nightlands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要找努阿达王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are looking for prince Nuada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.02,1:28:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他啊 我明白了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.56,1:28:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我点东西作为交换 就带你们去找他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trade me something, and I'll take you to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.79,1:28:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 我有条亮闪闪的腰带{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. I have a shiny belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.26,1:28:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我又没有裤子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have no pants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.70,1:28:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 一副奇妙的魔术眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, a wonderful set of magic eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.80,1:28:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经有望远镜了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already have binoculars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.87,1:28:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我看到些特别的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I see something special, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.70,1:28:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绷带下发亮的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}something shiny underneath the bandages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.91,1:28:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.44,1:28:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you can't take it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.14,1:28:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拔出来他会死的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not without killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.65,1:28:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我认识的某人可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I know someone who can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.48,1:28:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时你会跟我换吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you trade me then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.99,1:28:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.26,1:28:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.40,1:30:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走 继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going. keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.45,1:30:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.13,1:30:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们真该看看这座城市昔日的样貌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should have seen this city when it was alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.70,1:30:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么会变成这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.17,1:30:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,诅咒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.24,1:30:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从黄金军团在这里驻扎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as the golden army was stored here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.57,1:30:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾祸 寂静和死亡就落在我们头上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A plague of silence and death befell us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.14,1:30:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界也抛弃了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the world left us behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.65,1:31:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很长一段时间 我独居在这片废墟中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a long time, I alone dwelled in the dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.86,1:31:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦 小女孩 你们俩进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, little girl, the two of you come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.93,1:31:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩下的在外头等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you, wait out here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.05,1:31:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, old friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.48,1:31:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了几位客人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought you visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.72,1:31:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想请你帮个忙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have a favor to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.79,1:31:39.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小妖精 我可不想帮你忙 走吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe no favor to you, Goblin. leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.56,1:31:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我给你做了多少事啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I have done so much for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.69,1:31:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你带了好多纪念品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have brought you many souvenirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.70,1:31:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他身上有亮闪闪的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he has something shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.90,1:31:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.13,1:31:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,属于我的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.33,1:31:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.71,1:31:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anung un rama.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.44,1:31:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这名字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.58,1:32:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 伊莉莎白·谢尔曼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yours. Elizabeth Sherman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.02,1:32:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终你们还是来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.86,1:32:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等你们好久了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been waiting for you both many a winter moon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.37,1:32:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是他的死亡{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am his death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.04,1:32:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在命运的交叉点 我们会相遇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will meet him at each crossroads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.98,1:32:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 但那东西什么时候能归我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. but when can I have that which is mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.11,1:32:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能救他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you save him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.55,1:32:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,决定在你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is for you to decide that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.12,1:32:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,世事于我皆无不同{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is all the same to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.12,1:32:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的心早已尽是灰土与沙砾{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart is filled with dust and sand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.32,1:32:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你该知道 他注定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should know it is his destiny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.80,1:32:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,要给大地带来毁灭 这是他的命运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bring about the destruction of the earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.03,1:33:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是现在 不是明天 但就在不远的将来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not now, not tomorrow, but soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.18,1:33:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使这样你还是要救他吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing that, you still want him to live?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.29,1:33:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 做个选择吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, child, make the choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.76,1:33:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,要世界 还是要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world or him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.97,1:33:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.94,1:33:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时刻终会到来 而你 亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time will come and you, my dear, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.68,1:33:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,受的苦难将比任何人都多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will suffer more than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.01,1:33:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己会处理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll deal with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.58,1:33:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,救他好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now save him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.15,1:33:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.59,1:33:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了我能做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done what I can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.96,1:34:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 只有你才能把他唤醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, give him a reason to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.77,1:34:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 朋友 别忘了那东西是我的啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, friend, what about that which is mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.24,1:34:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我啊 我怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget about me. what about me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.05,1:34:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friend?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.66,1:34:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,亮得刺眼啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shiny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.23,1:34:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 你这只大猿猴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me, you big ape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.34,1:34:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.41,1:34:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须醒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.88,1:34:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你要当爸爸啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cause you're gonna be a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.17,1:35:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要当…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I become…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.47,1:35:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.62,1:35:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 好感人哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all this is very touching, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.49,1:35:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们要还想见努阿达 现在就得走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you still want to meet Nuada, we have to leave now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.36,1:35:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.43,1:35:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.40,1:35:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there they are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.87,1:35:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,70乘以70的士兵队列{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seventy times 70 soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.78,1:35:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时我真希望自己从没把它们造出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I wish I'd never created them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.88,1:35:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们挥舞大锤{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bim-bam went the hammers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.55,1:35:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,舞过之处尽是火焰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoosh went the furnaces!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.28,1:36:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的脚就是这样给烧掉的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And one of those fires took my legs off, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.99,1:36:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能走到这儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as I can go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.89,1:36:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,爬楼梯我可不在行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not very good with steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.53,1:36:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你们是来阻止王子的 祝你们好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you're here to stop him, the prince, I wish you luck then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.46,1:36:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金军团绝不能苏醒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The golden army must not awaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.53,1:36:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,弥补我们犯的过错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undo what we did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.80,1:36:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.19,1:36:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.42,1:36:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们带了剩下的碎片吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I assume you brought the remaining piece.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.66,1:36:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没带 但我们应该谈谈…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. we didn't, but we should discuss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.56,1:36:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别插嘴 铁罐男{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not addressing you, tin man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.93,1:36:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.10,1:36:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.27,1:36:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,如我承诺的 我妹妹很好 所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sister is well as I promised, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.53,1:36:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.53,1:36:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 亚伯拉罕{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.21,1:36:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该死的在做什么？{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.51,1:36:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也会为了丽兹这么做的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would do the exact same for Liz.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.74,1:36:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 西皮恩探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Sapien, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.77,1:37:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是努阿达·西弗兰斯王子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am prince Nuada, silverlance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.34,1:37:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄金军团的指挥官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader of the golden army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.91,1:37:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人想和我争权吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone here who would dispute my right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.29,1:38:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.46,1:38:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,但…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.56,1:38:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要啊{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.96,1:38:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他骗了我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.46,1:39:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯老兄 如果我们劫后余生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abe, old buddy, if we ever get out of this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.40,1:39:02.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥俩得好好谈谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.40,1:39:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,张大嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open wide!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.44,1:39:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,说什么坚不可摧 放屁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Industrable, my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.55,1:40:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,丢过来给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! throw me a bone here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.45,1:42:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,事态不妙了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:10.12,1:42:12.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我无计可施了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm out of ideas.{\r}
