Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.87,1:42:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向努阿达王子挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I challenge prince Nuada{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.24,1:42:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战他指挥军团的权力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the right to command this army.{\r}
