Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.12,1:42:40.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算哪根葱哪根蒜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you to challenge me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.72,1:42:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,无名小卒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nobody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.05,1:42:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有皇室血统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not royalty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.59,1:42:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以 他是阿努·恩·拉玛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. yes! he is Anung un Rama, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.87,1:42:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,堕落者之子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of the fallen one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.93,1:42:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有权挑战{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.06,1:42:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须回应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A challenge must be answered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.53,1:42:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:57.10,1:42:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 拜托 三思啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red, please. Red. think about it.{\r}
