Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.44,1:43:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个 别这样做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this, red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.97,1:43:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 宝贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.18,1:43:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯 我不会杀了他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna kill him, Abe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.05,1:43:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要踢烂他的屁股{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I am gonna kick his ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.61,1:45:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,红大个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.69,1:45:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,便车搭的不错吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice ride, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.99,1:46:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这跳来跳去 滑头滑脑的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jumpy, slippery bastard.{\r}
