Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.38,1:46:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须杀了我 因为我不会罢手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill me. you must, for I will not stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.05,1:46:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 伙计 我不杀你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot. sorry, pal.{\r}
