Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.15,1:46:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得活下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.22,1:47:06.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,努阿拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuala.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.85,1:47:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.88,1:47:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,终将抛弃你们的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will tire of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.29,1:47:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仇视过你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have already turned against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.62,1:47:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开他们吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.36,1:47:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,选他们还是选我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it them or us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.20,1:47:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,该选择屠杀哪一边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which holocaust should be chosen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.84,1:48:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直没有机会告诉你我的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had a chance to tell you how I felt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.02,1:48:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.73,1:48:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.{\r}
