Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.97,1:48:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界会因此更加贫瘠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the world will be poorer for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.68,1:48:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,努阿拉 我的妹妹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuala, my sister.{\r}
