Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.00,1:49:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,想都别想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't even think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.02,1:50:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. no, it's nothing.{\r}
