Dialogue: 0,1:50:31.36,1:50:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看腰带上的定位器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the belt locator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.36,1:50:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,查看腰带上的定位器 那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check the belt locators, over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.93,1:50:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.10,1:50:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子 你们并未获准开走飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, you took that plane without an authorization, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.44,1:50:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼宁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Manning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:50.21,1:50:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我如往常一样来帮你了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here to help as always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.38,1:50:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on? what's going on?{\r}
