Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.03,1:51:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该留着这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll keep this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.30,1:51:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.83,1:51:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔汉 不能这样的 你得阻止他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johann, they can't do this. stop them.{\r}
