Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.88,1:51:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前怎么说的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what you said before, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:25.24,1:51:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去哪儿定居好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About us living anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.68,1:51:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.91,1:51:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪里都好 你和我 - 回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anywhere. you and me. - Come on back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.11,1:51:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起在乡下找个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find a place in the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.22,1:51:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫你们回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said come on back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.45,1:51:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,空气清新 绿草如茵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clean air. green hills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:34.49,1:51:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有很多房间的大院子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A yard with lots of room to grow in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.06,1:51:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对宝宝会很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be great for the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.46,1:51:42.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是宝宝们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies.{\r}
